  "note": "Most are non-canonical adventures that work in any order once you know the crew. Strong World, Z and Red were made with the manga's author and are the ones usually recommended. Episode of Alabasta and Episode of Chopper Plus retell arcs from the television series rather than adding to it. Four of the earliest were shown as double features and run under an hour."
